        &lt;template&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;p&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="email-container"&gt;
&lt;div class="header"&gt; &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="content"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dear ${visitor.full_name},&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are excited to welcome you to our premises. To ensure a seamless visit, please take a moment to review the important information below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="instructions"&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Orientation Checklist:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date &amp;amp; Time:&lt;/strong&gt; ${start_date} - ${end_date}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; ${location.name}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Host Contact:&lt;/strong&gt; ${host.full_name}&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Check-In Process:&lt;/strong&gt; Upon arrival, please use the kiosk or front desk to check in.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Safety Protocols:&lt;/strong&gt; Masks are required in all common areas, and hand sanitizers are available throughout the facility.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visitor Badge:&lt;/strong&gt; A badge will be issued at check-in and must be worn at all times.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recommend arriving 10-15 minutes early to allow time for check-in and orientation. If you have any specific needs or require special assistance, please let us know in advance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For a detailed guide on our policies, safety procedures, and more, click the link below:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;a class="cta-button" href="[Insert Orientation Guide URL]" rel="nofollow"&gt;View Visitor Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="footer"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have any questions, feel free to reach out to us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
